# 【rack-b 斷電】放 2 份在 rack-b 的分區只剩 1 份 < min.insync.replicas 2:這些分區 acks=all 寫不進去
$ docker stop broker3 broker4;acks=all 寫 600 筆;docker start broker3 broker4
▶ 機架 rack-b 整個斷電:停 broker3 broker4 
低於 min.insync.replicas 的分區(acks=all 會被擋):
  Partition: 1	Leader: 11	Replicas: 14,11,13	Isr: 11
  Partition: 3	Leader: 11	Replicas: 14,11,13	Isr: 11
  Partition: 4	Leader: 11	Replicas: 14,11,13	Isr: 11
  共 3 個分區(總共 6 個)
acks=all 寫 600 筆(輪流寫到 6 個分區,每個分區約 100 筆):topic 實際多了 300 筆
判定:機架 rack-b 斷電後,3 個分區低於 min.insync.replicas,只寫進 300 / 600 筆(撐不過整個機架故障)
